            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nurse Nut"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is exactly what my mother used to put on chocolate cakes!!!! I grew up with this and it's delicious! Do as the other reader said and make sure you have a golden brown finish or you miss out on some of the flavor burst, along with the gooey consistency you'll end up with if it's not done enough. THANK YOU for this!!!",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-18T12:39:48.750Z"
          },
